---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="Built and maintained by William"
	pubDate={new Date()}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		Hi! I'm William, and I built and faithfully maintain this site.
	</p>

	<p>
		If you have any suggestions, feature requests, or just want to drop a note to say this has been a blessing on your journey with God, I'd absolutely love to hear from you! 
	</p>

	<p>
		I’m always looking for ways to use the gifts God has given me to serve others, so please don't hesitate to reach out and let me know how I can be of more help through this project.
	</p>
</Layout>
